{"symbol":"EXHICON","yahoo":"EXHICON.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Exhicon Events Media Solutions Limited","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Advertising Agencies","website":"https://exhiconevents.in","about":"Exhicon Events Media Solutions Limited provides products and services for exhibitions, conferences, conventions, and events industries in India. The company offers various portfolio of solutions, such as event conceptualization and management, exhibition design and execution, temporary and permanent event infrastructure, media and integrated marketing, branding, advertising, and venue support services. It is also involved in design, fabrication, and execution of B2B, B2C, government, corporate, hybrid exhibitions, trade fairs, conventions, and experiential events. In addition, the company provides exhibition ecosystems, venue as service and construction, aviation logistics, religious tourism mobility, international exhibitions, media and trade publications, temporary and permanent infrastructure, golf and lifestyle venues, and event IP services. It serves central and state government bodies, industry associations, exhibition organizers, multinational corporations, hospitality, food and beverage, FMCG, healthcare, manufacturing, infrastructure, international trade, and service sectors. Exhicon Events Media Solutions Limited was founded in 1997 and is based in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T12:43:23+00:00","quote":{"price":514.85,"prevClose":525.85,"marketCap":760.25,"high52":595.0,"low52":390.0,"pe":20.74,"bookValue":135.12,"dividendRate":0.15,"roe":26.99,"shares":1.4767,"insiders":59.88,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2023-04-17","2023-04-18","2023-04-19","2023-04-20","2023-04-21","2023-04-24","2023-04-25","2023-04-26","2023-04-27","2023-04-28","2023-05-02","2023-05-03","2023-05-04","2023-05-05","2023-05-08","2023-05-09","2023-05-10","2023-05-11","2023-05-12","2023-05-15","2023-05-16","2023-05-17","2023-05-18","2023-05